Description: hw/intc: Add the i.MX21 AITC interrupt controller
 The i.MX21's interrupt controller has the i.MX31 AVIC's register layout,
 but its vector registers report the highest-priority pending source
 without acknowledging it: sources are level-sensitive and stay pending
 until their device drops the line. Model it as its own device.
 .
 Start a MAINTAINERS entry for the i.MX21's headers with it.
